Update 1.7.0 is out now! We have add a lot of cool new features to the game:

- Grab >>> to counter shield we have added grab into the game. You have a normal grab and a run grab!

- Spectate mode >>> it is now possible to spectate a friendly match. You can spectate by going to multiplayer > friendly and click on the button spectate. If the match is already ongoing, then you will need to go to main menu > friends > click on your friend > click on the spectate button. There is a limit of 16 persons that can spectate a match. Spectators will NOT cause lag during a match because your are connected to our server. 

- Rejoin >>> it is now possible to rejoin for Ranked and Friendly when you have a disconnection or other problem. Just go back to multiplayer mode and you will see a button poppin up to rejoin your last session.

- Land lag is added to the game;

- AI improvements;

- Performance improvements;

We will now focussing to add more content to the game. Next step is to add the Aztec warrior “Tonatiuh” into the game in 3 weeks from now!

